WEBVTT

00:10:29.708 --> 00:10:31.143
but we should catch up later.

00:10:31.167 --> 00:10:32.434
Cohh: Sounds great!

00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:34.958
(Applause)

00:10:36.958 --> 00:10:39.167
ES: So that was a new way to interact.

00:10:40.083 --> 00:10:43.476
We could influence
what happened on the stream,

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.333
we could cocreate
the experience along with him,

00:10:48.917 --> 00:10:54.250
and we really had a multiplayer experience
with chat and with Cohh.

00:10:55.333 --> 00:10:57.976
At Twitch, we've started calling this,

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.333
as a result, "multiplayer entertainment."